research/advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23-batch-14.notes.md:86:The escalations are not caused by draft status, pending precheck, or missing independent approval. The remaining issue is substantive: page-13 consistency proof step 2.2 has an unexpanded coherence calculation, and the gauge-label/automorphism convention needed by the conditional two-group gauging instance is unspecified. Batch 14 therefore records its page-13 dependency as open and does not claim the two-group instance is proved. The batch-14 row itself remains dependency level 1 with requires ["13"]. Its recomputed row matches the stored row, while the owner-controlled full shared batch-level dependency digest is stale after run-manifest changes; that shared file was not edited.
