    - title: "Sakura Schäfer-Nameki, ICTP Lectures on (Non-)Invertible Generalized Symmetries"
      url: https://arxiv.org/pdf/2305.18296v2
      locator: "§2.5, printed pp. 23–25, and §2.8.1, printed pp. 28–32"
