[F2] [[thm-aqft-two-group-background-consistency]]: the displayed vertex/edge gauge parameters act by $a'_{ij}=g_i a_{ij}g_j^{-1}$ and $B'_{ijk}=\rho_{g_i}B_{ijk}+\zeta^g_{ijk}+\rho_{a'_{ij}}\lambda_{jk}-\lambda_{ik}+\lambda_{ij}$ and preserve the background equation. Its current Step 1 readiness hash is stale, so use is conditional until refreshed.

